  "cited_article_id": "configure-online-appointment-booking",
  "reply": "To restrict online bookings, first enable the feature under **Settings > Patient Portal > Booking Rules** by toggling on **Allow Online Appointment Booking**. Then, go to **Scheduling > Visit Types**, select each visit type you want available, and check **Available Online**. Finally, under **Settings > Schedule > Provider Availability**, mark only the providers you wish to accept online requests. Only those providers with active schedules and rooms will appear to patients."
}
